  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "カロスちほうの　せいたいけいが\nくずれると　すがたを　あらわして\nひめた　ちからを　はっきするらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "칼로스지방의 생태계가\n무너지면 모습을 나타내어\n숨겨진 힘을 발휘한다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsque l’écosystème de Kalos est menacé,\nce Pokémon apparaît et utilise son mystérieux pouvoir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn das Ökosystem der Kalos-Region kippt,\nerscheint dieses Pokémon und offenbart seine\ngeheimen Kräfte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando el ecosistema de Kalos se encuentra en\npeligro, aparece y revela su poder secreto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Secondo le leggende, quando l’equilibrio\ndell’ecosistema della regione di Kalos è in pericolo,\nappare e libera il suo potere misterioso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls into\ndisarray, it appears and reveals its secret power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "カロス地方の　生態系が　崩れると\n姿を　現して\n秘めた　力を　発揮するらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando el ecosistema de Kalos se encuentra en\npeligro, aparece y revela su poder secreto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どうくつの　おくふかくで　くらし\nせいたいけいを　はかいする　ものを\nかんししていると　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동굴 깊은 곳에서 지내면서\n생태계를 파괴하는 자를\n감시하고 있다고 전해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il paraît qu’il vit au fond d’une grotte, d’où il\nsurveillerait les personnes qui détruisent l’écosystème.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wird gemutmaßt, dass es von seiner Höhle aus\nall jene beobachtet, die dem Ökosystem Schaden\nzufügen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en las profundidades de las cavernas, desde\ndonde vigila a todos aquellos que se dediquen a\ndestruir el ecosistema.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che viva nelle profondità di una caverna e\nprotegga l’equilibrio dell’ecosistema da qualsiasi\nminaccia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s hypothesized that it’s monitoring\nthose who destroy the ecosystem\nfrom deep in the cave where it lives.",
